{#
GitHub Weekly Discovery Thread Template
Weekly thread highlighting trending repos, star velocity anomalies,
and ecosystem growth in crypto open source.
#}

{# === ENGLISH VERSION === #}

{% block en_thread %}
{# Tweet 1: Hook — lead with the top discovery #}
1/{{ total_tweets }} {{ hook_emoji }} {{ top_discovery.repo }} just hit {{ top_discovery.stars_per_day | round(0) | int }} stars/day — {{ top_discovery.velocity_change }}x its normal rate.

{{ top_discovery.one_liner }}

Weekly GitHub Alpha below:

{# Tweet 2: Top project deep dive with chart #}
2/{{ total_tweets }} {{ top_discovery.repo }}

{{ top_discovery.description }}

Stars: {{ top_discovery.total_stars | format_number }} (+{{ top_discovery.stars_7d | format_number }} this week)
Forks: {{ top_discovery.forks | format_number }}
Language: {{ top_discovery.language }}
{% if top_discovery.latest_release %}
Latest release: {{ top_discovery.latest_release }}{% endif %}

[ATTACH: {{ star_velocity_chart_filename }}]

{# Tweet 3-5: Notable repos #}
{% for repo in notable_repos[:3] %}
{{ loop.index + 2 }}/{{ total_tweets }} {% if repo.alert_level == "HIGH" %}🔴{% elif repo.alert_level == "MEDIUM" %}🟡{% else %}🟢{% endif %} {{ repo.repo }}

{{ repo.description | truncate(120) }}

+{{ repo.stars_7d }} stars this week ({{ repo.stars_per_day | round(1) }}/day)
Trend: {{ repo.trend }}{% if repo.category %} | Category: {{ repo.category | replace("_", " ") | title }}{% endif %}
{% if repo.context_note %}
{{ repo.context_note }}{% endif %}

{% endfor %}

{# Tweet 6: Ecosystem treemap #}
{{ notable_repos | length + 3 }}/{{ total_tweets }} Ecosystem Growth Map — where the stars are flowing this week:

{% for cat in ecosystem_summary %}
{{ cat.emoji }} {{ cat.name }}: +{{ cat.weekly_stars | format_number }} stars ({{ cat.growth_pct }}%)
{% endfor %}

[ATTACH: {{ ecosystem_treemap_filename }}]

{# Tweet 7: New repo discoveries #}
{{ notable_repos | length + 4 }}/{{ total_tweets }} New repos on our radar:

{% for new in new_discoveries[:5] %}
- {{ new.repo }} ({{ new.stars }} stars, {{ new.language }}) — {{ new.source }}
{% endfor %}

{% if new_discoveries | length > 5 %}
+{{ new_discoveries | length - 5 }} more tracked in our dashboard
{% endif %}

{# Tweet 8: Arena connection (optional) #}
{% if arena_angle %}
{{ notable_repos | length + 5 }}/{{ total_tweets }} {{ arena_angle }}

Top Arena traders are watching these protocol developments closely.
Track their positioning: https://arenafi.org
{% endif %}

{# Tweet 9: CTA #}
{{ total_tweets }}/{{ total_tweets }} Full analysis with charts and data:
{{ openclaw_url }}

Follow for weekly crypto GitHub intelligence.
Methodology: Z-score anomaly detection on star velocity across {{ repos_tracked }} repos.
{% endblock %}

